EDreamUIDocumentChangeReason.UndoRedo {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Public/Text/DreamUIDocument.h#EDreamUIDocumentChangeReason:UndoRedo
    src   "The transaction system put an older (or newer) Content back.\n\nUndo and redo are one value on purpose -- see the PostEditUndo comment: the engine does not\ntell us which one this was, and the document's response is identical either way."
    text  "事务系统把一个更旧（或更新）的 Content 放了回来。\n\n撤销和重做有意共用一个值——参见 PostEditUndo 的注释：引擎不会\n告诉我们这是哪一个，而文档对两者的响应完全相同。"
    state machine
}
